sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Code / Pipeline
    participant TH as training_hub API
    participant Registry as AlgorithmRegistry
    participant Algo as Algorithm Instance
    participant Backend as Backend Instance

    Note over User, Backend: Flow 1: SFT / OSFT Training (In-Process)

    User->>TH: training_hub.sft(model, data, config)
    TH->>Registry: get_algorithm("sft")
    Registry->>Algo: SFTAlgorithm(backend="instructlab")
    Algo->>Backend: InstructLabBackend.execute_training()
    Backend->>Backend: instructlab-training.run_training()<br/>(TrainingArgs, TorchrunArgs)

    alt Multi-Node / Multi-GPU
        Backend->>Backend: torchrun launch<br/>(rdzv_endpoint, nproc_per_node)
        Note right of Backend: TCP (NCCL/Gloo)<br/>rdzv_id coordination
    end

    Backend-->>Algo: Training complete
    Algo-->>User: Checkpoint directory path

    Note over User, Backend: Flow 2: LoRA GRPO - ART Backend (Single-GPU)

    User->>TH: training_hub.lora_grpo(model, data, rewards)
    TH->>Registry: get_algorithm("lora_grpo")
    Registry->>Algo: LoRAGRPOAlgorithm(backend="art")
    Algo->>Algo: _decompose_multiturn_traces()<br/>(N-turn → N per-turn samples)
    Algo->>Backend: ARTLoRAGRPOBackend.execute_training()

    Note right of Backend: Subprocess isolation<br/>(vLLM threading compatibility)

    Backend->>Backend: subprocess.spawn(training)
    Backend->>Backend: vLLM engine (in-process time-sharing)<br/>Policy rollouts + training interleaved
    Backend->>Backend: Reward evaluation<br/>(tool-call verifier / custom)
    Backend->>Backend: _shutdown_art_backend()<br/>(gc.collect + engine destroy)
    Backend-->>Algo: Training metrics + checkpoint
    Algo-->>User: Checkpoint + training_metrics.jsonl

    Note over User, Backend: Flow 3: LoRA GRPO - verl Backend (Multi-GPU)

    User->>TH: training_hub.lora_grpo(model, data,<br/>backend="verl", rewards)
    TH->>Registry: get_algorithm("lora_grpo")
    Registry->>Algo: LoRAGRPOAlgorithm(backend="verl")

    participant Ray as Ray Cluster
    participant vLLM as vLLM Workers

    Algo->>Backend: VeRLLoRAGRPOBackend.execute_training()
    Backend->>Backend: subprocess.spawn(verl)
    Backend->>Ray: Initialize Ray cluster<br/>(TCP, distributed compute)
    Ray->>vLLM: Distribute rollout generation<br/>(NCCL, multi-GPU)
    vLLM-->>Ray: Generated rollouts
    Ray->>Ray: FSDP training step
    Ray-->>Backend: Live log output<br/>(parsed to training_metrics.jsonl)
    Backend->>Backend: Merge tokenizer into checkpoint
    Backend-->>Algo: Checkpoint + metrics
    Algo-->>User: Checkpoint directory

    Note over User, Backend: Flow 4: GEPA Prompt Optimization

    participant LLM as LLM API<br/>(via litellm)
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server

    User->>TH: training_hub.gepa(prompt, eval_data)
    TH->>Registry: get_algorithm("gepa")
    Registry->>Algo: GEPAAlgorithm(backend="gepa")
    Algo->>Backend: GEPABackend.execute_training()

    loop Evolutionary Generations
        Backend->>LLM: Mutate prompts<br/>(HTTPS/443, API key)
        LLM-->>Backend: Mutated candidates
        Backend->>LLM: Judge prompt quality<br/>(HTTPS/443, API key)
        LLM-->>Backend: Evaluation scores
        Backend->>Backend: Genetic-Pareto selection
    end

    opt MLflow Registry
        Backend->>MLflow: Log optimized prompt<br/>(HTTP/HTTPS, Token)
        MLflow-->>Backend: Prompt version ID
    end

    Backend-->>Algo: Optimized prompt
    Algo-->>User: Best prompt + metrics
